					<h2 >ADDITIONAL TERMS FOR A CREATIVE</h2>
					<li><h3 class="text-bold">REGISTER WITH US</h3>
						<ol>
							<li>In order to use our Platform as a creative, you will need to create and verify a profile on the Platform.</li>
							<li>Once you have registered, filled in all necessary information and uploaded your ID for verification, our dedicated team will carefully check your details and notify you if your profile has been approved.</li>
							<li>By registering with us, you agree to be bound by these terms of use in relation to your use of the Platform.</li>
							<li>You agree to take care when providing us with your details and warrant that these details are accurate and complete at the time of registration and are not false or misleading or misrepresent your identity.</li>
						</ol>
					</li>
				
					<li><h3 class="text-bold">MAKING A BOOKING</h3>
						<ol>
							<li>Once you have been verified on the Platform you can make a booking by creating a new project on the Projects page and filling out all the necessary information (including dates and rates for your project).</li>
							<li>Once a booking has been confirmed with a model, you will be sent a Modelling Service Agreement	 setting out iDAL’s terms of service.</li>
						</ol>
					</li>
				
					<li><h3 class="text-bold">PAYMENT</h3>
						<ol>
							<li>iDAL charge 10% of the project fee and VAT for each booking (“<span class="text-bold">Booking Fee</span>”).</li>
							<li>Once a booking has been secured with a model, payment for the project will be taken through a third party payment service provider, <a href="https://www.stripe.com">Stripe</a>. We accept the majority of payment cards such as Visa, Mastercard or American express. Payment amount will be held in a iDAL client account. Upon completion of the booking, payment of the Booking Fee, any disbursements or payments to models will be made automatically.</li>
							<li>An alternative form of payment is via invoice. This payment option is <span class="text-bold">only available to clients through prior written agreement with iDAL</span>. Once a booking has been secured with a model, iDAL will send you a Service Agreement which will set out the payment amount and payment terms for the project. An invoice will then be generated for the project. You will be able to access invoices via the Platform and you will need to pay the invoice within the agreed period of time.</li>
							<li>For further information on billing methods, see iDAL's <a href="/faq">FAQ’s here</a>.</li>
						</ol>
					</li>
				
					<li><h3 class="text-bold">CANCELLATION</h3>
						<ol>
							<li>If a project is cancelled by a client within 24 hours of the project start time, 30% of the full project fee will remain payable.</li>
							<li>If a project is cancelled more than 24 hours before the project start date, 90% of the full project fee, less iDAL’s Fees will be refunded.</li>
							<li>If a project is cancelled prior to payment, there will be obligation to pay.</li>
						</ol>
					</li>
					<h2>ADDITIONAL TERMS FOR A MODEL</h2> 
					<li><h3 class="text-bold">REGISTER WITH US</h3>
						<ol>
							<li>In order to use our Platform as a model, you will need to create and verify a profile on the Platform.</li>
							<li>Once you have registered, filled in all the necessary information and uploaded your ID for verification, our dedicated team will carefully check your details and notify you if your profile has been approved.</li>
							<li>By registering with us, you agree to be bound by these terms of use in relation to your use of the Platform.</li>
							<li>You agree to take care when providing us with your details and warrant that these details are accurate and complete at the time of registration and are not false or misleading or misrepresent your identity.</li>
						</ol>
					</li>
					
					<li><h3 class="text-bold">PAYMENT</h3>
						<ol>
							<li>iDAL charge 10% of the project fee for each booking (“<span class="text-bold">Model Fee</span>”).</li>
							<li>You will be paid into your bank account within 30 days upon completion of the booking.</li>
							<li>iDAL will not be responsible for any any incorrect or inaccurate bank details supplied via the platform.</li>
							<li>Payment will be made via third party payment provider, <a href="https://www.stripe.com">Stripe</a>.</li>
						</ol>
					</li>
				
					<li><h3 class="text-bold">CANCELLATION</h3>
						<ol>
							<li>If a project is cancelled by creative at least 24 hours prior to the project start date, a payment will be fully cancelled.</li>
							<li>If a creative cancels your job less than 24 hours of the job start date you will receive 20% of the agreed fee.</li>
						</ol>
					</li>
